---
description: Environment guards and safety checks (manual invoke when needed).
---

## Purpose
Prevent misconfigured runs; surface environment and config issues early.

## Applies When
- Manual/Agent-requestable before running training/eval jobs.

## Do
- Confirm `conda activate esm` and Python 3.10+ interpreter.
- Validate GPUs/CPUs visibility; print device summary.
- Dry-run config parsing; print final resolved hyperparams.
- Seed everything and log seed values.

## Commands / Checklist
- `source ~/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate esm`
- `python -c "import torch; print(torch.cuda.device_count())"`
